cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite NS-P14-Lean. The formalization
  is work in progress; consult the README for its verified scope.
type: software
title: NS-P14-Lean
authors:
  - family-names: Sato
    given-names: Keisuke
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0005-4230-0268
repository-code: https://github.com/stksk310/NS-P14-Lean
url: https://github.com/stksk310/NS-P14-Lean
abstract: >-
  A Lean formalization project for NS-P14, concerning a comparison of
  total Betti numbers of tangent cones of numerical semigroup rings
  with their interval completions over arbitrary fields. The repository
  includes Lean proofs, Japanese mathematical manuscripts, verification
  scripts, and audit evidence. The whole-P14 formalization is not yet
  complete. Original software is licensed under Apache-2.0; original
  manuscripts and explanatory documentation are licensed under CC-BY-4.0.
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - numerical semigroups
  - tangent cones
  - Betti numbers
